            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; stroke: currentColor; fill: none; stroke-width: 2;"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
            Compras
